{{ define "content" }}
<div class="widget large">
	<h2 class="widget-header">FAQ</h2>

	<div class="question">Why do I need to enter my email address?</div>
	<div class="answer">
		To securely reset your password in case you forget it.
		Note that emails are securely stored and never used for other purposes.
	</div>

	<div class="question">What can I do on this website?</div>
	<div class="answer">Here you can play chess with other players or with chess engine.</div>

	<div class="question">Other information</div>
	<div class="answer">
		JustChess.org is developed by <a href="https://github.com/treepeck">Artem Bielikov</a>.
		<br/>
		See <a>YouTube broadcasts</a> if you are interested in the development process.
	</div>

	<div class="question">License</div>
	<ul class="answer">
		<li>Source code is licensed under <a href="http://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/">MPL 2.0</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://stockfishchess.org/">Stockfish</a> chess engine used under <a href="https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish?tab=readme-ov-file#terms-of-use">GNU GPL v3</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://github.com/canonical/Ubuntu-Sans-fonts">Ubuntu fonts</a> used under <a href="https://canonical.com/legal/font-licence">UBUNTU FONT LICENCE Version 1.0</a></li>
		<li><a href="https://github.com/treepeck/justchess/tree/main/_web/assets/fonts">JustChess fonts</a>, <a href="https://github.com/treepeck/justchess/tree/main/_web/assets/images">images</a>, and <a href="https://github.com/treepeck/justchess/tree/main/_web/assets/sounds">sounds</a> are licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/deed.en">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a></li>
	</ul>

	<div class="widget-buttons">
		<button autofocus class="widget-back" onclick="window.history.back()">Back</button>
		<button class="widget-home" onclick="window.location.href='/'">Home</button>
	</div>
</div>
<div class="animated-chessboard"></div>
{{ end }}